  {
   "id": "note-pattern",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 540,
   "y": -237,
   "width": 700,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "Compression pattern (config compress_ratios): L0–1 ÷128, then ÷4 / ÷128 alternate (even layers ÷4). ÷4 layers pool every 4 tokens (overlapping windows) into one 512-dim latent and index them; ÷128 layers pool 128 tokens into one — at 1M tokens that is 8,192 blocks, all attended. L0–2 (amber frame) route experts by a fixed tid2eid table 129280×6."
  },
  {
   "id": "xo14",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -137,
   "y": 117,
   "width": 573,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
