   "y": 370,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`main_x [T, 7168] → keys/values of the draft window`"
  },
  {
   "id": "dblk35",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2850,
   "y": 431,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 80,
   "text": "**3 DSpark blocks** — mHC, window attention (128) over main_x + the 5 draft slots, MoE 6/384  \n77.21B",
   "color": "#f59e0b"
  },
  {
   "id": "dembed",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 3230,
   "y": 431,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 80,
   "text": "**embed** (main's table): [next token, 4× noise id 128799] → ×4 lanes",
   "color": "6"
  },
  {
   "id": "dhead36",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2850,
   "y": 551,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 80,
   "text": "**mHC head → norm → lm head** (main's) + Markov bias (rank 512)  \n132.5M",
   "color": "#f59e0b"
  },
  {
   "id": "dconf37",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2850,
   "y": 671,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**confidence head** — one score per draft  \n0.0M",
   "color": "#f59e0b"
  },
  {
   "id": "dids38",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2980,
   "y": 767,
   "width": 40,
   "height": 9,
   "text": "",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-lbl39",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 3170,
   "y": 755,
   "width": 440,
   "height": 34,
   "text": "`draft ids [5] + confidences`"
  },
  {
   "id": "dver40",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2850,
   "y": 816,
   "width": 300,
   "height": 56,
   "text": "**verify**: main model checks all 5 drafts in one forward",
   "color": "#64748b"
  },
  {
   "id": "note-dspark",
   "type": "text",
   "x": 2850,
   "y": 902,
   "width": 640,
   "height": 150,
   "text": "DSpark = speculative block drafter (3 stages, 77.50B stored, checkpoint namespace mtp.0–2). It reads the main model's hidden states and drafts 5 tokens per round; the main model keeps the drafts it agrees with. config.json says num_nextn_predict_layers = 1, but the checkpoint and inference/config.json (n_mtp_layers = 3) have 3 stages. Verify/accept is done by the serving stack; the repo's code ships the draft forward only."
  },
  {
   "id": "note-src",
   "type": "text",
   "x": -1400,
   "y": -337,
   "width": 1100,
   "height": 230,
   "text": "**Sources.** config.json, inference/config.json and safetensors headers of deepseek-ai/DeepSeek-V4-Pro-0813 (149,782 tensors). Attention / shared experts FP8 E4M3 (128×128 block scales, not counted); routed experts FP4 e2m1 packed 2 per byte in I8 tensors, **counted as 2 params per byte** (1/32 scales not counted). Main model = **1573.00B**, +77.50B DSpark. Dataflow from the repo's inference/model.py. Context 1,048,576 = 65,536 × YaRN 16."
  }
 ],
